    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d364">

                <pb facs="0537" n="495" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg495"/>

                <head>Lord Lyons to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-01-17"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 17, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I beg to offer you my thanks for your note
                    of the day before yesterday’s date, and for the translation, which you were so
                    good as to send with it, of a communication, dated the 8th instant, which you
                    had received from Mr. Tassara, concerning the affair of the Blanche.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, &amp;c.,
                    &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LYONS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
